<title>USA: Daniel sees loss for qtr ending Dec 31.</title>
<headline>Daniel sees loss for qtr ending Dec 31.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daniel Industries Inc said on Thursday it expected to report a loss in the quarter ending December 31 due to costs associated with its planned merger with Bettis Corp and lower operating results.</p>
<p>The company also said both it and Bettis's shareholders had approved their planned merger at special meetings. Daniel and Bettis said in September they signed a definitive agreement to merge, with Bettis shareholders to receive 0.58 Daniels shares for each Bettis share held.</p>
</text>
